  "description": "Lightweight C# library for transliteration (Cyrillic ⇆ Latin).\nSupported languages: Serbian, Russian, Bulgarian, Ukrainian, Georgian, Greek, Belarusian, Macedonian, Armenian, Kazakh.\nUse either direct Conversion methods or convenient string extension methods (e.g. ToSerbianLatin(), ToGreekCyrillic(), etc.).",
  "id": "Cyrillic.Convert",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-04-11T22:13:04.933Z",
